    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_94ef40c156be6103e29d",
      "document_start": 109,
      "document_end": 148,
      "text": "从系统结构特征看，自动机是一个多能量范畴耦合的复杂系统，是典型的状态确定系统。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_585465cba96438d47223",
      "document_start": 148,
      "document_end": 223,
      "text": "自动机的所有组成部分在其运动空间中的表述（主要指位置空间矢量），都可由系统中的一个或若干个独立状态变量确定，独立状态变量主要表现为基础构件的位置矢量。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e8035277b27d0be45d29",
      "document_start": 223,
      "document_end": 294,
      "text": "这样的系统一方面表现为包含可以用独立状态变量和初始条件表述的复杂反馈控制系统，另一方面表现为运动的循环性和周期性，即系统动作的重复性和可控性。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ad320bec7c92bfa90f18",
      "document_start": 296,
      "document_end": 316,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_29e3535f80dfbd97f180",
      "document_start": 317,
      "document_end": 329,
      "text": "# 第2章 最小化设计;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_234f7963981566198770",
      "document_start": 330,
      "document_end": 362,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0e56790fe7334ec5a13d",
      "document_start": 364,
      "document_end": 477,
      "text": "最小化设计原则的思想是：对于选定弹种和原理的自动机，在初始条件和边界条件（技术指标、材料和工艺能力等）给定的情况下存在最小的结构极限，设计的目的就是要找到这个结构极限，实现最优化设计，这样设计的自动机具有最好的发展与改进潜力。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8bb4449fae2eea54c33f",
      "document_start": 477,
      "document_end": 549,
      "text": "最小化设计原则具体表现为在循环图、核心关键件的刚强度、热容及疲劳等因素综合约束下，以实现相同功能条件下的自动机体积和质量最小为目标的最优化设计。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_38ffce391a674845231a",
      "document_start": 551,
      "document_end": 571,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_266968741af92a9cb331",
      "document_start": 572,
      "document_end": 589,
      "text": "# 2.1.2 构件尺寸约束分析;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2a07d8abb88f7135e35c",
      "document_start": 590,
      "document_end": 622,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_74e9d10941372646ea86",
      "document_start": 624,
      "document_end": 687,
      "text": "对自动机构件来讲，由功能要求所形成的约束条件是最重要的约束条件，下面分别从物质流、能量流、信息流所确定的尺寸三个角度进行论述。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5f5b8a01b1b244881571",
      "document_start": 689,
      "document_end": 709,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a0af1439fe9be002c8c7",
      "document_start": 710,
      "document_end": 724,
      "text": "# 二、能量流所确定的尺寸;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e4a948e8e08a159e8db8",
      "document_start": 725,
      "document_end": 757,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9e80d301b70678966ca6",
      "document_start": 759,
      "document_end": 834,
      "text": "（2）对于承受热载荷的构件，在允许的最严酷工作条件下，工作温度必须控制在正常使用的范围内，如果可能超过，可视情况采取增大热容或局部冷却的方式满足要求。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7ebc23dbe05ecf6ff237",
      "document_start": 836,
      "document_end": 856,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5cc213a5c66c3a625b85",
      "document_start": 857,
      "document_end": 876,
      "text": "# 2.1.3 构件最小化设计的特点;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_07f0f7b3e76d74c56b67",
      "document_start": 877,
      "document_end": 909,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f193bb2e4e0501df1e34",
      "document_start": 911,
      "document_end": 938,
      "text": "在一定理论假设条件下确定的，即通常所说“划圆理论圈”。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e9e84081b4ce2858b6ad",
      "document_start": 938,
      "document_end": 1047,
      "text": "实践证明：“理论圈”划圆后，至少可以保证原理样机的研制可行，核心关键件的刚强度、热容等能够满足初步试验的要求，但一些存在复杂运动的构件在可靠性等方面还会有较大缺陷，表现为理论极限小于最终满足实际要求的极限，即实际极限。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5b5d2f54a0c12edbf9bb",
      "document_start": 1047,
      "document_end": 1081,
      "text": "自动机是一个“内向性”的复杂系统，其特点是机构由小往大变化相对容易。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1b30da8f9f5f2fae8e17",
      "document_start": 1081,
      "document_end": 1130,
      "text": "向大方向变化时，机构的运动特征和结构保持性较好，应力极限条件相对改善，前期试验结果的继承性也较好。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b281a4237f3df2a44c76",
      "document_start": 1130,
      "document_end": 1169,
      "text": "而反过来，则很多时候要推翻前面的设计与试验结果，全部重新开始，造成很大的浪费。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_453d8a2d6dc7c3455d14",
      "document_start": 1169,
      "document_end": 1213,
      "text": "为此，通过理论加试验的方法，从理论极限逐步扩大逼近实际极限是合理的，在实践中也行之有效。",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_58190548913abb7cbfa1",
      "document_start": 1215,
      "document_end": 1235,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_071e2ec1bb39b65a3b37",
      "document_start": 1236,
      "document_end": 1253,
      "text": "# 2.4.2 循环图的基本分段;",
      "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402"
    },
    {
