        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f193bb2e4e0501df1e34",
          "document_start": 911,
          "document_end": 938,
          "text": "在一定理论假设条件下确定的，即通常所说“划圆理论圈”。",
          "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402",
          "start": 911,
          "end": 938,
          "chunk_start": 911,
          "chunk_end": 938,
          "sentence_document_start": 911,
          "sentence_document_end": 938,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e9e84081b4ce2858b6ad",
          "document_start": 938,
          "document_end": 1047,
          "text": "实践证明：“理论圈”划圆后，至少可以保证原理样机的研制可行，核心关键件的刚强度、热容等能够满足初步试验的要求，但一些存在复杂运动的构件在可靠性等方面还会有较大缺陷，表现为理论极限小于最终满足实际要求的极限，即实际极限。",
          "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402",
          "start": 938,
          "end": 1047,
          "chunk_start": 938,
          "chunk_end": 1047,
          "sentence_document_start": 938,
          "sentence_document_end": 1047,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5b5d2f54a0c12edbf9bb",
          "document_start": 1047,
          "document_end": 1081,
          "text": "自动机是一个“内向性”的复杂系统，其特点是机构由小往大变化相对容易。",
          "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402",
          "start": 1047,
          "end": 1081,
          "chunk_start": 1047,
          "chunk_end": 1081,
          "sentence_document_start": 1047,
          "sentence_document_end": 1081,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1b30da8f9f5f2fae8e17",
          "document_start": 1081,
          "document_end": 1130,
          "text": "向大方向变化时，机构的运动特征和结构保持性较好，应力极限条件相对改善，前期试验结果的继承性也较好。",
          "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402",
          "start": 1081,
          "end": 1130,
          "chunk_start": 1081,
          "chunk_end": 1130,
          "sentence_document_start": 1081,
          "sentence_document_end": 1130,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b281a4237f3df2a44c76",
          "document_start": 1130,
          "document_end": 1169,
          "text": "而反过来，则很多时候要推翻前面的设计与试验结果，全部重新开始，造成很大的浪费。",
          "section_id": "section_ab798d91a402",
          "start": 1130,
          "end": 1169,
          "chunk_start": 1130,
          "chunk_end": 1169,
          "sentence_document_start": 1130,
          "sentence_document_end": 1169,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
